        "created_at": "2012-12-11T04:11:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>honestly, its been so many years since i played a CCG that you drew at the begining (That being magic) i didnt even double take with Sentinels. Every card game, CCG and otherwise, that we've played has been end of turn draw... Except Nutz. But thats a funny fun times game :p</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
